{"strongs": "H2742", "word": "חָרוּץ", "translit": "cha.ruts", "root": "חרף", "morph": "H:A", "pos": "adjective", "gloss": "sharp, diligent", "definition": "I. חָרוּץ adjective sharp, diligent (on this and following see Ba NB 173 ) — חָרוּץ Isa 28:27 + 11 t.; plural חֲרוּצִים Prov 10:4 ; Prov 12:24 חֲרֻצִים Prov 13:4 חֲרֻצוֺת Amos 1:3 — 1. sharp: of threshing instrument חָדָשׁ ׳ מוֺרָג ח Isa 41:15 without ׳ מ , as substantive, Isa 28:27 (where יוּדַשׁ ); הַבַּרְזֶל ׳ ח Amos 1:3 ; Job 41:22 (figurative of crocodile). 2. figurative diligent: as substantive Prov 21:5 opposed to רְמִיָּךְ Prov 10:4 ; Prov 12:24 ; Prov 12:27 opposed to עָצֵּל Prov 13:4 . — Dan 9:25 see IV. חרוץ .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3156')\">BDB3156</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2742')\">H2742</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3155')\">BDB3155</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3157')\">BDB3157</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>חָרוּץ</bdbheb> <b>adjective</b> <highlightword>sharp, diligent</highlightword> (on this and following see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ba')\">Ba<sup>NB 173</sup></lookup>) — <bdbheb>חָרוּץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 28:27\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(23,28,27)\">Isa 28:27</ref> + 11 t.; plural <bdbheb>חֲרוּצִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 10:4\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(20,10,4)\">Prov 10:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 12:24\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(20,12,24)\">Prov 12:24</ref> <bdbheb>חֲרֻצִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 13:4\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(20,13,4)\">Prov 13:4</ref> <bdbheb>חֲרֻצוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 1:3\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(30,1,3)\">Amos 1:3</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>sharp:</highlight> of threshing instrument <bdbheb>חָדָשׁ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מוֺרָג ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 41:15\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(23,41,15)\">Isa 41:15</ref> without <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb>, as substantive, <ref ref=\"Isa 28:27\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(23,28,27)\">Isa 28:27</ref> (where <bdbheb>יוּדַשׁ</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>הַבַּרְזֶל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 1:3\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(30,1,3)\">Amos 1:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 41:22\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(18,41,22)\">Job 41:22</ref> (figurative of crocodile). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> figurative <highlight>diligent:</highlight> as substantive <ref ref=\"Prov 21:5\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(20,21,5)\">Prov 21:5</ref> opposed to <bdbheb>רְמִיָּךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 10:4\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(20,10,4)\">Prov 10:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 12:24\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(20,12,24)\">Prov 12:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 12:27\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(20,12,27)\">Prov 12:27</ref> opposed to <bdbheb>עָצֵּל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 13:4\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(20,13,4)\">Prov 13:4</ref>. — <ref ref=\"Dan 9:25\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(27,9,25)\">Dan 9:25</ref> see IV.  <bdbheb><reflink>חרוץ</reflink></bdbheb>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Isa 28:27", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 28, "verse": 27}, {"raw": "Prov 10:4", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 10, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Prov 12:24", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 12, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "Prov 13:4", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 13, "verse": 4}, {"raw